{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/63188-looking-for-exalted-2e-players-online","id":63188,"title":"[Looking for] Exalted 2E players online","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-01T17:39:54-08:00","id":63188,"title":"[Looking for] Exalted 2E players online","content":"<span style=\"color:#454545\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">Hello, for a while now I've had to get my fix for Exalted in a play by post format and sadly nearly each and every one of those games had either died or is slow enough to be mistaken for the process of dying. Then one of the rper's on the site I used mentioned that Exalted would be better suited to playing on a chat client. That being said, I'm looking for someone to run and maybe others to play an Exalted game on Skype, my time zone is at GMT -5. Sadly I won't be able to get and will be leery of 3E for the time being, that and the only physical copies I have are of 2E. If anybody is interested, please let me know and we can work out any details. </span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/839-justacritic","name":"justacritic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T23:03:16-08:00","id":63315,"title":"","content":"I might be interested, depending on when it would happen. Assuming it would be a mixed group, I've been wanting to try playing an Infernal. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1899-rats808","name":"Rats808","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1899_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T21:07:01-08:00","id":64564,"title":"","content":"I would be up for it. Warning I am a total newb and so far only have the Second Edition handbook pdf, the Glories of the Most High pdfs, and the Scroll of Errata as of yesterday evening, though I have been wanting to play for over a year and a half. I have a variable work schedule, though even with worst schedule like this week's I am available from about 10-10:30pm-2:00am Monday-Saturday (except Wednesdays), usually have sundays completely off, have some Mondays off, and usually have 2-3 days where I am available from 4pm-2am. All of this is Central Standard Time for the USA. Sorry, for the information overload, but thought you should know how work affects my availability before deciding if you want to let me join if you find a ST.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2011-barret","user":"Barret","date":". 02-04-2014, 12:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2011-barret","name":"Barret","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-08T08:47:04-08:00","id":67913,"title":"","content":"Alright so far we got two possible players. We still need somebody to GM however, or shall we do so by rotation? Also got any friends who might be interested?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/839-justacritic","name":"justacritic","avatar":"data:i